{"version":1,"content":"<p>達美航空稱，周日全美範圍內超過1600架次達美航班出現延誤，故障原因為一套飛機重量平衡系統中斷。本次設備故障恰逢感恩節出行高峯，數百萬民眾計劃本周出行；就在幾天前，美國聯邦航空管理局（FAA）因設備安裝問題引發通信故障，發佈了「9・11」事件以來第二次全國範圍地面停飛指令。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587622.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T09:23:53.224427+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T09:02:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T09:17:13.166516+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T09:17:13.166516+00:00","content_hash":"4d230a5dd7cf4bc37b5cad349884ea6a806ee28bbfe70ea9bfcd166fbf2d44d0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}